  "slug": "mascarpone-frosting",
  "name": "Mascarpone Frosting",
  "recipe_type": "dessert",
  "brief_description": "This decadent mascarpone frosting is made with whipping cream, vanilla, and sugar and can be used for filling cakes or decorating cupcakes and tortes.",
  "cuisine": null,
  "instructions": [
    {
      "position": 1,
      "text": "Beat together cream, mascarpone, and vanilla in a large bowl with an electric mixer until smooth and creamy. Add sugar gradually, mixing continuously until frosting is smooth and stiff peaks form, about 5 minutes. Use immediately or store covered in the refrigerator."
    }
  ],
